# Justfile path rule

When creating, editing, migrating, checking, or discovering Just recipes / justfiles, use `/justfile`.

- **Own:** new justfiles, recipe/module edits, Makefile→just or npm→just migration, house-style lint/check, recipe discovery (`just --list` / `--show` / `--dump`).
- **Hygiene-only** (naming, layout notes, thin shell/Makefile pointers without Just authoring): `shell-conventions`.
- **Do not** use `shell-scripter` for Just authoring; that skill owns shell scripts and Make file-timestamp builds, not justfiles.

Inspect `just --version` before relying on mid-2026 attributes. Prefer `/justfile` over ad-hoc Just edits when this path rule fires.
